      "text": "flowchart TB\ninX((fragment input))\nendp[\"wire endpoint · ℓᵢ\"]\nRx2@{ shape: trapezoid, label: \"Rₓ\" }\ninX --> endp\nendp -->|one aux port| Rx2",
